@startuml mediator_composition
title Mediator: Implementation Units and Dependencies
top to bottom direction
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam componentStyle rectangle
skinparam packageStyle rectangle
skinparam ArrowColor #46535E

package "mediator" {
  [MediatorImpl\n<size:9>dispatch, forwarding, close</size>] as Mediator #DCEFE2
  [DecodeContextCreationRequest] as Decoder
  [HandlerSelector] as Selector
  [ProviderArbiter] as Arbiter
  [ContextAssembler] as Assembler
  [MediatorFactory\n<size:9>builds registries, selector, assembler</size>] as Factory #DCEFE2
}

package "daemon/common/context" {
  [Context factory,\nresource resolver and\nmediator query registries\n<size:9>KeyedRegistry</size>] as Registries #FFF0CC
  interface IMediatorRegistrar #DCEBFA
  [Context-scope\ncapability table] as Selection #FFF0CC
  [ContextDataNode] as ContextNode
  interface Handler #DCEBFA
  [InitializationParams] as InitParams #FFF0CC
}

package "daemon/key_management" {
  [KeyManagementService] as KeyMgmt
  [KeyManagementModule] as KeyModule
}

package "daemon/provider" {
  [ProviderManager] as Providers
  interface IProvider #DCEBFA
  interface ICryptoHandlerFactory #DCEBFA
}

package "daemon/data_manager" {
  interface IDataManager #DCEBFA
}

Mediator --> Decoder : CTX_CREATE parameters
Mediator --> Selector
Mediator --> Assembler
Mediator --> IDataManager : forwarding, close
Mediator --> Registries : looks up, read-only

Factory ..> Mediator : creates
Factory --> Registries : builds
Factory --> IMediatorRegistrar : calls Register
Factory ..> Selector : builds once
Factory ..> Arbiter : builds once
Factory ..> Assembler : builds once
KeyModule ..|> IMediatorRegistrar
KeyModule --> KeyMgmt

Decoder ..> Selection

Selector --> Registries : factory lookup
Selector --> Arbiter : provider-served types
Arbiter --> Providers
Arbiter --> KeyMgmt : key affinity
Arbiter ..> ICryptoHandlerFactory : creates handler
Providers --> IProvider : registers
IProvider ..> ICryptoHandlerFactory : provides

Assembler --> IDataManager : context node
Assembler --> KeyMgmt : bind and authorize
Assembler ..> ContextNode : creates
Assembler ..> Handler : initializes
Assembler ..> InitParams : builds

ContextNode --> Handler : holds

legend bottom
  |= Fill |= Role |
  |<#DCEFE2> | Request dispatch |
  |<#DCEBFA> | Contracts supplied by other components |
  |<#FFF0CC> | Provider-neutral values and policy tables |
  |<#FFFFFF> | Implementation unit |
endlegend

@enduml
